    "failure_scenario": "Startup output for GitLab reads 'GitLab project minimum access level', 'GitLab backups to keep', 'GitLab compare method', then 'Gitlab backup LFS: true'; anyone grepping logs for 'GitLab backup LFS' misses it. Now that all GitLab lines flow through label-parameterised helpers, hoist a single label constant per display function."
